And this is the other issue. because these are driven by constants in C++, they are treated as integers, which results in `glUniform1i` being called instead of `glUniform1ui` and thus these two uniforms error out and don't get set.

Note that with this change, you also need to update the relevant defines to use `int` instead of `uint`.
